PROJECT ARCHITECTURE REVIEW
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  BACKEND (FastAPI + SQLModel + PostgreSQL/asyncpg):
  ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
  app/main.py                          FastAPI entry point, CORS, startup hooks
  app/api/api_v1/api.py                Central router (registers all endpoint modules)
  app/api/api_v1/endpoints/
    signals.py                         POST / (ingest signal), GET / (list signals)
    incidents.py                       GET /active, GET /{id}, GET /{id}/logs,
                                       GET /{id}/cot
    websocket.py                       WS /{incident_id} (real-time log streaming)
    simulation.py                      POST /trigger/{id}, GET /state/{id}
  app/ai/
    specialists.py                     8 specialist agents definitions
    factory.py                         Model factory (Groq / OpenAI / default)
    prompts.py                         System prompts for all 8 agents
    orchestrator.py                    Triage agent entrypoint
    tools/
      geo.py                           reverse_geocode (Google Maps API)
      news.py                          search_local_news (SerpApi)
      notify.py                        send_notification
      traffic.py                       get_traffic_matrix
      weather.py                       get_weather_alerts
      nearby_signals.py                get_nearby_signals (DB query)
      resource_manager.py              allocate_resource (DB write)
      planner.py                       create_action (DB write)
      tracer.py                        emit_log, persist_chain_of_thought
  app/models/
    signals.py                         Signal ORM model
    incidents.py                       Incident ORM model
    reasoning_logs.py                  ReasoningLog + ChainOfThought ORM models
    actions.py                         Action ORM model
    resources.py                       Resource ORM model
    schemas.py                         Pydantic V2 request/response schemas

  FRONTEND (React Native + Expo):
  ────────────────────────────────
  app/map.tsx                          Map screen — fetches active incidents, shows
                                       markers, handles signal submission
  components/LiveLogStream.tsx         Real-time WebSocket log viewer per incident
  lib/api.ts                           Centralized API client
  constants/config.ts + config.js      API base URL + Islamabad center coordinates

  MULTI-AGENT PIPELINE (Sequential, run in background after POST /signals):
  ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  Step 1: Signal Agent       → reverse_geocode (location extraction)
  Step 2: Detection Agent    → search_local_news, get_traffic_matrix, get_nearby_signals
  Step 2.5: Verification Agent → (conditional, only if low confidence / conflict)
  Step 3: Severity Agent     → get_weather_alerts, get_traffic_matrix
  Step 4: Resource Agent     → allocate_resource (writes to resources table)
  Step 5: Planning Agent     → create_action (writes to actions table)
  Step 6: Notification Agent → send_notification
  Each step: Logging Agent   → emit_log (saves to reasoning_logs, broadcasts WS)

