CURRENT OPEN ISSUES / NEXT TASKS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  Issue 1: Missing Actions Endpoint — MEDIUM PRIORITY
  Description : Planning Agent writes tactical actions to the actions table but
                there is no API endpoint to retrieve them per incident.
  Fix needed  : GET /api/v1/incidents/{id}/actions

  Issue 2: Missing Resources Endpoint — MEDIUM PRIORITY
  Description : Resource pool data (ambulances, rescue crews) has no public
                GET endpoint. Dashboard cannot display allocation visuals.
  Fix needed  : GET /api/v1/resources

  Issue 3: WebSocket Early Log Gap — HIGH PRIORITY (for live demo)
  Description : Early pipeline logs (Signal Agent, Detection Agent, Severity Agent)
                are broadcast to the "triage" WS channel. Frontend can't subscribe
                to this channel because it doesn't know the signal_id before
                the incident is confirmed. Early logs are lost.
  Root Cause  : Two-phase disconnect between "pre-incident" and "post-incident"
                agent steps vs. single incident-scoped WebSocket subscription.
  Proposed Fix: POST /signals returns signal_id → frontend connects to
                ws/.../triage to see all early logs → switch to incidentId WS
                channel once confirmed.

